# Arboreal Grazer: "you may put a land card from your hand onto the battlefield tapped." Bot1 plays its Forest for the turn, taps
# it for the Grazer; the hand holds an Island, a Plains and a Lightning Bolt. Bot1 chooses the Island: it enters tapped, the
# Plains stays, the Bolt (not a land card) is refused, and the land drop was already used - putting it is not playing it
# (CR 305.2), LandsPlayed stays 1. Reach is shown on the permanent. Forest cost {G} is checked exactly.

